justin[neutral]: Can I say what this is? Plainly.
you: Zero fingers.
justin: You're my person. The one I don't turn into anybody for.
justin[shy]: People say that like it's the smaller thing. It isn't. I've had crowds. I've never had this.
you: You're mine too. I've had a lot of doors. I've never had someone on the other side of one.
